  "text": [
    "Boat anglers had a tough week.",
    "Some fish were caught, but overall, the fishing was slow.",
    "A few fish were caught in 95 feet of water, but the best action was beyond 100 feet.",
    "Most of the fish were caught on spoons.",
    "Pier fishing was very slow for all species.",
    "Perch fishing was good for one day, but the rest of the week was challenging.",
    "Anglers were fishing around 30 feet of water."
